{
  "info": {
    "name": "whatsapp-mcp",
    "description": "Simulação do fluxo n8n → whatsapp-mcp (POST /api/messages com Bearer estático).\n\nPipeline ativo: NLU + Guided Flow (Option B). Mensagens de texto livre passam pelo classifier → NLU → router de flows; cliques (lists/buttons) chegam em `interactive_reply` e vão direto pro flow ativo.\n\nOrdem sugerida:\n1. Health\n2. OAuth flow → First message → Follow shortlink → (login manual no browser)\n3. Flows Option B → liste templates / envelopes / cria envelope / add signer / cancel\n4. Error cases (auth, body inválido, idempotência)\n\nDefina `api_token` no environment com o mesmo valor de `API_STATIC_TOKEN` do `.env`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "8b3e4c7a-2a1f-4e2b-9a3d-7c4f0a1d2c10"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /healthz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/healthz",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["healthz"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. OAuth flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "First message (expect needs_auth)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.status === 'needs_auth') {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('authorize_url', body.authorize_url || '');",
                  "  const match = (body.reply || '').match(/https?:\\/\\/[^\\s]+\\/c\\/[A-Z0-9]+/);",
                  "  if (match) pm.environment.set('short_link', match[0]);",
                  "  console.log('captured authorize_url:', body.authorize_url);",
                  "  console.log('captured short_link:', pm.environment.get('short_link'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"olá\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0001\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Follow shortlink (302 → authorize_url)",
          "description": "Reproduz o que o usuário faz ao clicar no link curto recebido no WhatsApp. Deve retornar 302 com Location apontando para o /login do Cognito da Clicksign.",
          "protocolProfileBehavior": {"followRedirects": false},
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{short_link}}",
              "host": ["{{short_link}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "(manual) Open authorize_url in browser",
          "description": "Cole o valor de `{{authorize_url}}` em uma aba anônima. Faça login na Clicksign. Você será redirecionado para `{{base_url}}/oauth2/callback?code=…&state=…`, verá a página HTML de sucesso e (se N8N_WEBHOOK_URL estiver setado) o n8n receberá o webhook `oauth_success`.",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authorize_url}}",
              "host": ["{{authorize_url}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Flows (Option B)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar templates",
          "description": "intent=list_templates. Quando o usuário tem múltiplas contas, a resposta vem com `interactive` (list de contas) e `flow_state.flow_id=select_account`. O próximo turno deve mandar `interactive_reply.list_item_id` = account_key.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"liste meus templates\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0002\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Selecionar conta (interactive_reply)",
          "description": "Use depois de receber a lista de contas. Substitua `account-key-uuid` pelo id do item clicado (vem em `interactive.items[i].id`).",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"interactive_reply\": { \"list_item_id\": \"<account-key-uuid>\" },\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0002.click\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar envelopes",
          "description": "intent=list_envelopes (sem filtro). A resposta vem com `interactive` (lista de envelopes); clicar em uma linha transfere para envelope_status.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"liste meus envelopes\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0003\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar envelopes em andamento",
          "description": "intent=list_envelopes com filter_status=running. NLU normaliza pt-BR → enum canônico Clicksign.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"liste meus envelopes em andamento\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0004\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Status de envelope por nome",
          "description": "intent=envelope_status. Faz fuzzy match em `envelope_name`; 1 match → detalhes; N matches → lista pra escolher; 0 → mensagem amigável.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"qual o status do envelope Contrato Stg 1?\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0005\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar envelope (PDF por URL)",
          "description": "intent=create_envelope_pdf. NLU extrai pdf_url, envelope_name e signers; o flow valida (papel PT→EN, e-mail, nome completo) e responde com card de confirmação + botões.\n\nSe faltar campo, vem KindAsk. Se signer for inválido (e-mail/nome ruim), vem com a lista de problemas.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"envia esse PDF https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf, nome do envelope Contrato Stg 1, signatário Mikael Nunes mikael@example.com como parte\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0006\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar envelope (PDF por anexo do WhatsApp)",
          "description": "Mesma intent, mas o PDF veio como mídia do WhatsApp e o n8n já re-hospeda em URL pública (Estratégia A, ver docs/N8N_INTEGRATION_CONTRACT.md). O flow usa `attachments[0].url` como pdf_url automaticamente.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"manda esse contrato pra Maria Souza maria@empresa.com como parte\",\n  \"attachments\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf\",\n      \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n      \"filename\": \"contrato.pdf\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0007\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar criação (button click)",
          "description": "Depois do card de confirmação (`flow_state.step=awaiting_confirm`). `button_id=confirm_yes` dispara POST /envelope_bulk_creations. `confirm_no` cancela com mensagem amigável.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"interactive_reply\": { \"button_id\": \"confirm_yes\" },\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0008\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Adicionar signatário a envelope",
          "description": "intent=add_signer. NLU extrai envelope (id ou nome) e o primeiro signer (name/email/role). O flow valida e pede confirmação antes de POSTar.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"adicione o signatário Maria Souza maria@empresa.com como parte no envelope Contrato Stg 1\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0009\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancelar / excluir envelope (draft)",
          "description": "intent=cancel_envelope. O flow faz pre-flight: se o envelope não estiver em `draft`, recusa antes de oferecer o botão (Clicksign v3 não cancela envelopes em andamento via API). Caso esteja em draft, mostra o card destrutivo com `confirm_yes`/`confirm_no`.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"cancela o envelope Contrato Stg 1\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0010\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Off-topic & capabilities",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Saudação (meta_help)",
          "description": "Classifier marca como meta_help → resposta estática `llm.Capabilities()` sem custo do NLU.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"bom dia! O que você pode fazer aqui?\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0011\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Off-topic",
          "description": "Classifier marca como off_topic → resposta `llm.OffTopic()` sem chamar NLU nem flows.",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"quanto é 2 + 2?\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.0012\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Error cases",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "No Authorization header → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"oi\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Wrong Bearer → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer wrong-token"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"oi\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Invalid payload → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Idempotency — first call",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"teste idempotencia\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.dup-001\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Idempotency — duplicate (expect empty reply)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('reply is empty (deduped)', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.reply).to.eql('');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{api_token}}"},
              {"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"message\": \"teste idempotencia\",\n  \"message_id\": \"wamid.dup-001\"\n}",
              "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Shortlink inexistente → 410",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/c/INEXISTENTE12345",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["c", "INEXISTENTE12345"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {"key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8080"},
    {"key": "phone_number", "value": "+5511999999999"}
  ]
}
